        "content": "<p>jrandolf opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14834\">PR #14834</a> from <code>jrandolf:map-codegen-tests</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This adds a <code>map.wit</code> codegen test, which gets compiled with each of the <code>bindgen!</code> option variants and snapshotted in <code>tests/expanded</code>, plus runtime tests that use <code>HashMap</code> through <code>TypedFunc</code> and a typed host function. Neither path had any coverage outside of fuzzing.</p>\n<p>The snapshots intentionally record the current output (including <code>std::collections::HashMap</code> and the by-value map parameters), so the follow-up PRs for those show up as snapshot diffs.</p>\n<p>Closes #14813<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
