        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14834#discussion_r4327482798\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could this and the above test be folded together? Not much of a reason to keep them separate</p>\n</blockquote>",
