    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14834#discussion_r4327477019\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could this actually be added as a <code>*.wast</code> test instead? That'll I suspect require adding map support to the <code>wasmtime-wast</code> crate, but I think tests like this would be best supported elsewhere rather than in the <code>func.rs</code> suite</p>\n</blockquote>",
